servers</h2><p class="muted">These nameservers are currently assigned to your domain.</p><?php foreach(['nameserver1','nameserver2','nameserver3','nameserver4'] as $ns): if(!empty($r[$ns])): ?><div class="detail-line"><span><?=strtoupper($ns)?></span><strong><?=e($r[$ns])?></strong><button class="btn secondary small copy-value" type="button" data-copy="<?=e($r[$ns])?>">Copy</button></div><?php endif; endforeach;?><h3 style="margin-top:22px">Transfer Authorization</h3><div class="security-note">EPP/Auth codes are sensitive transfer credentials. WDH only displays them inside your signed-in account.</div><?php if($epp):?><div class="detail-line"><span>EPP / Auth Code</span><div class="secret-field"><input type="password" value="<?=e($epp)?>" readonly autocomplete="off"><button class="btn secondary small reveal-secret">Show</button><button class="btn secondary small copy-secret">Copy</button></div></div><?php else:?><p class="muted">An EPP/Auth code has not been recorded yet. Contact WDH Support to request transfer assistance.</p><?php endif;?><a class="btn secondary" href="domain-transfer.php?id=<?=$id?>">Request Transfer Assistance</a></section></div><section class="cart-card"><h2>Domain Actions</h2><p class="muted">Need to renew or transfer this domain? Start a request and WDH will assist you.</p><div class="actions" style="flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn primary" href="renew-service.php?id=<?=$id?>">Renew Domain</a><a class="btn secondary" href="support.php?service_id=<?=$id?>&category=domain">Open Domain Support Ticket</a></div></section></main><script>(function(){document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-secret').forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){var i=b.parentElement.querySelector('input');var x=i.type==='password';i.type=x?'text':'password';b.textContent=x?'Hide':'Show';};});document.querySelectorAll('.copy-value').forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){navigator.clipboard.writeText(b.dataset.copy||'').then(function(){var o=b.textContent;b.textContent='Copied';s